{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_014iwFMoCzN8zdL1VgGjoy15","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## runtime-host — planning trio session summary (grounded claims)\n\n**Source:** `skills/gandalf/planning/runtime-host/` — `IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md` (member doc) + `DESCRIPTION.md` (Foreman intake).\n\n### What is being built\n- **Claim:** The effort builds the **missing \"thin runtime entry\"** for the already-shipped Gandalf v1 skill — the open follow-up recorded in `crucible-advisor/EXECUTION-LOG.md`, `LESSONS.md`, and `journal/0001`. *(DESCRIPTION §What is being built)*\n- **Claim:** It takes a live analysis's **RAW (un-stamped) draft** and runs it through the **already-shipped deterministic seam engine** (`seam/*.mjs`) to emit a **canary-conformant, honestly-graded** advisor output validated by the shipped `test/harness.mjs assertIncrement1Conformant`. *(DESCRIPTION)*\n- **Claim — motivation:** Without the host, the model \"keeps hand-approximating tier stamps and failing the canary\"; the host makes grades **deterministic instead of model-self-asserted**. *(DESCRIPTION)*\n\n### Scope = Tier-1 (deterministic) by design\n- **Claim:** Runs the deterministic seam pass on **ONE model run**; does **NOT** dispatch live independent named-defeater refuters or the researchPrime SITUATE commission — those need the `agent()` seam flagged as \"the integration point the gate never runs\" (`seam/refute.mjs:26-28`). *(DESCRIPTION §Scope)*\n- **Claim:** Therefore every **elevation honestly lands at SPECULATIVE** with the `NO_INDEPENDENT_REFUTATION_STAMP`; diagnosis findings keep evidence rungs + `gandalf_core` provenance; `risk_labels` capped at single-family **PROMISING**; only **REFUTED** drops. *(DESCRIPTION)*\n- **Claim:** The live-refuter PROMISING tier is an explicitly **sequenced follow-on, not in this effort**. *(DESCRIPTION; IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN Wave 3)*\n\n### Reuse / non-fork discipline\n- **Claim:** Reuses 